(* fs-records-s2b bound K_r = 1: one attacker-scheduled Beacon receive
   attempt after the finish.  Used for the witnesses and the control that
   need no later receive (A3, S4, C-NOGATE) and for the replay-rejected
   witness C5c, whose replayed frame is the response frame that the finish
   accepted. *)
expand FS_S2B_RECV_STEP(FsS2bRecv1, FsS2bRecvStop).
